/-!
# Exact half-line signs of the 83-degree Laguerre gap kernel

After the integer dilation x ↦ 10^19 x, each ray polynomial has 41 explicit
monic quadratic divisors with negative discriminants and positive linear
remainders. Division is exact over the integers. Only the factor coefficients
need to be stored. The final quotient has positive constant and nonnegative
coefficients.
-/

